  - profile `mine`: <HOME>/.local/share/ricepilot/profiles/mine/hypr/hyprland.lua is a Lua config, which nothing can check before a login (NOT-POSSIBLE.md#verify-lua-config)
  - profile `mine`: no manifest has been recorded for it yet, so its tree was not compared with anything
